ress hosting from the team that makes this plugin, tuned for speed and for sites in many languages.'=>'Marti-gelinta WordPress ee kooxda samaysay barnaamijkan dheeraadka ah, taas oo loo habeeyay xawaaraha iyo mareegaha ku baxa luqadaha badan.','See Zinn Digital® hosting'=>'Eeg martigelinta Zinn Digital®','Hire a WordPress expert on ZinnHub'=>'Kireyso khabiir ku takhasusay WordPress ee ZinnHub','A freelance marketplace for WordPress design, development, translation and SEO work.'=>'Goob suuq madax bannaan oo loogu talagalay naqshadaynta WordPress, horumarinta, turjumaadda iyo shaqada SEO.','Visit ZinnHub'=>'Booqo ZinnHub','Bulk site and PBN hosting'=>'Dejinta mareegaha iyo PBN-ka ee bulk-ga ah','PBN.ltd is our platform for hosting and managing many sites at once.'=>'PBN.ltd waa madalkayaga lagu martigeliyo laguna maamulo bogag badan hal mar.','Visit PBN.ltd'=>'Booqo PBN.ltd','Get Page Builder Sandwich Pro and Tranzly Pro together'=>'Soo hel Page Builder Sandwich Pro iyo Tranzly Pro wadajir','The bundle costs less than buying both plugins separately, on the same plans and site limits.'=>'Xirmaduhu waxay ku kacayaan xoogaa ka jaban intii lagu iibsan lahaa labada qalab (plugin) si gooni-gooni ah, iyadoo la raacayo qorshayaasha iyo xadka mareegaha ee isku midka ah.','See the bundle'=>'Fiiri xirmooyinka','Get %s'=>'Helo %s','Integration active: %1$s and %2$s work together'=>'Isku-xirka waa uu shaqaynayaa: %1$s iyo %2$s wada jir ayaa loo adeegsadaa','%s is active on this site, so both plugins share one set of AI provider keys and one settings screen for them.'=>'%s ayaa ka dhex shaqaynaysa boggan, sidaas darteed labada tiagfureba waxay wadaagayaan hal konteenar oo fureyaal bixiyaha AI ah iyo hal shaashad oo dejinta iyaga ah.','Translate this site with Tranzly'=>'Ku turjun boggan adigoo isticmaalaya Tranzly','Build pages visually with Page Builder Sandwich'=>'Bogagga si muuqaal ah ugu dhis Page Builder Sandwich','%s, from Zinn Digital®'=>'%s, oo ka socota Zinn Digital®','Publish every page in many languages, with translated addresses, SEO data and a language switcher. Works with the pages you build here.'=>'Daabac bog kasta oo ku qoran luqado badan, adoo adeegsanaya cinwaanno la turjumay, xogta SEO iyo beddelaha luqadda. Wuxuu la shaqeeyaa boggag aad halkan ku dhiseyso.','Design pages right in the editor with fast, footprint-free blocks. Everything you build translates with Tranzly.'=>'Ku naqshadee bogagga si toos ah tifaftiraha iyadoo la adeegsanayo baloogyo degdeg ah oo aan lahayn raad raad. Wax kasta oo aad dhisato waxaa turjumaya Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s waxaa sameeyay isla kooxdaas waxayna si wada jir ah ula shaqaysaa furahan.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Markab ahaan ha ka oggolow in aad marka hore ku xirto boggan.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Geli iimayl sax ah.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Markab ahaan ha oggolaan in hore loo soo diro macluumaadka taageerada.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Qor mawduuc iyo fariin.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Geli ciwaan iimayl ah oo taageerada farsamadu ay ku soo jawaabi karto.','Temporary support access created by the site owner. It is deleted automatically when it expires.'=>'Gelitaanka taageero ku-meel-gaar ah oo uu abuuray mulkiilaha boggu. Waxaa si toos ah loo tirtiraa marka ay dhacdo.','Choose 1, 3 or 7 days.'=>'Dooro 1, 3 ama 7 maalmood.','Only a site administrator, signed in to this screen, can create temporary support access.'=>'Kaliya maamulaha bogga, ee ku soo galay shaashaddan, ayaa abuuri kara gelitaanka taageerada ku-meelgaarka ah.','A unique user name could not be chosen. Try again.'=>'Magaca isticmaale ee gaarka ah lama dooran karo. Dib u day.','Zinn Digital® support (temporary)'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® (ku-me-gaar ah)','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Gelitaankii taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ahayd waa ay dhacday.','AI providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Sameeyeyaasha ChatGPT. Qalab guud oo wanaagsan.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Abuurayaasha Claude. Ku xooggan qorista iyo sababaynta taxaddarka leh.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Moodeellada Gemini ee Google. Waa kuwo dhakhso badan oo jaban.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Shirkad AI oo Yurub ah oo leh moodallo degdeg ah, jaban.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Qaabab jaban oo ku fiican qorista iyo koodhka.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Hal fure oo loogu talagalay moodooyinka bixiyeyaal badan oo kala duwan.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Adeeg kasta oo u shaqeeya sida OpenAI\'s API, oo ay ku jirto qaab ay ku shaqeyneyso kombiyuutarkaaga ama adeegahaaga.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Guud ahaan (la isticmaalo marka aan wax gaar ah la cayimin)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Qorid iyo dib-u-qorid','Translation'=>'Turjumaad','Code and CSS'=>'Code iyo CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, looguma oggola inaad gasho boggan.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Dejinnitan waxaa wadaaga dhammaan furayaasha adeegsada: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Furayaashaaga waxaa lagu kaydiyaa xog-ururinta boggan waxaana loo diraa oo keliya bixiyaha aad dooratay — weligood annogu nama soo gaaraan.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Tallaabada 1 ee 2: dooro bixiye AI ah','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Waxaad keenaysaa furahaaga gaarka ah, markaa waxaad si toos ah uga bixisaa bixiyaha wixii aad isticmaasho. Ma hubtid? Mid kasta oo ka mid ah kuwan ayaa si fiican u shaqeeya; waxaad ku dari kartaa kuwo kale markii dambe.','Next'=>'Kan xiga','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Tallaabada 2 ee 2: ku xidh %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Geli cinwaanka adeeggaaga OpenAI-waafaqsan, oo ku dhammaada /v1. Furaha waxa la rabaa oo keliya haddii adeeggu uu mid codsado.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fur %s oo lagalay (ama abuur akoon bilaash ah).','the %s API keys page'=>'bogga furayaasha API ee %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Abuur fure cusub oona koobiyo.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Halkan ku dheji oo riix "Keydi oo tijaabi". Waxaan dirноq codsi aad u yar si aan u hubino inuu shaqeynayo.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Int aksiiro ah ayaa inta badan u baahan xoogaa deyn ah oo ku jirta akoonka ka hor inta uusan fure shaqayn: %s.','add credit'=>'kordhi lacagta','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Dooq bixiye kale','Address'=>'Cinwaanka','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Furaha la kaydiyay wuxuu ku dhammaanayaa …%s — dhejiso mid cusub si aad u bedesho','Key (optional)'=>'Furaha (ikhtiyaari)','API key'=>'Furaha API','Save and test'=>'Keydi oo tamiiti','Providers'=>'Bixiyeyaasha','Provider'=>'Bixiyaha','Status'=>'Xaaladda','Key'=>'Furaha','Get a key'=>'Hel furaha','Test'=>'Tijaabi','Remove'=>'Ka tirtir','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Nooca cusub ee qalab-kordhinta ayaa keydiyay: cusboonaysii qalab-kordhintakan, ama mar labaad gelifuraha.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Furaha la keydiyay hadda lama furi karo (furayaasha amniga ee boggu waa is beddeleen). Geli mar kale.','Not connected'=>'Lama xiriirin','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Ku xiran — imtixaankii ugu dambeeyay wuu guuleystay %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Imtixaankii ugu dambeeyay wuu fashilmay: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Ku xidhan — wali lama tijaabin','Which model to use'=>'Waa maxay moodeelka la isticmaalayo','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ waxay calaamad u tahay taladayada hawshaas. Liisku waxa uu ka kooban yahay moodel kasta oo ay furahaagu isticmaali karo, oo si toos ah looga akhriyay adeeg-bixiyaha.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Waxaa lagula talinayaa bixiyaha —','Save models'=>'Keydso moodellada','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Ka cusboonaysii liiska noocyada bixiyeyaasha','Images'=>'Sawirrada','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Ku xir OpenAI ama Google Gemini si aad sawiro u samayso.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Qaabka sawirka ee ugu dambeeyay ee bixiyaha ugu horreeya ee xiran —','best quality'=>'tayada ugu fiican','lowest cost'=>'qiimaha ugu hooseeya','fastest'=>'ugu dhaqso badan','Add a model yourself'=>'Sidaada ugu dar moodel','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Maanta ma nooc cusub soo baxay? Geli magaciisa saxda ah si aad si toos ah u isticmaasho.','Model name'=>'Magaca moodelka','Add model'=>'Ku dar qaabka','Recommended models list'=>'Liiska moodellada lagu taliyay','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Liiska moodallada lagu taliyay lama xaqiijin karo, markaa wax talo ah lama soo bandhigayo. Dib u rakib furaha (plugin-ka), ama shid casriyeynta maalinlaha ah ee hoose.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Liistada la isticmaalayo waxaa la daabacay %s. Cusboonaysiin kasta oo plugin ah waxay keentaa mid cusub.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Sidoo kale hubi Zinn Digital® hal mar maalintii si aad u hesho liis la cusboonaysiiyay.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Kaliya codsi soo dejin oo fudud ayaa la dirayaa: ma jiro furaha, ciwaanka goobta, wax ku saabsan nuxurkaaga. Liiska waa la saxiixay, liiska ku guuldareysta hubinta saxiixa waa la iska indhatirayaa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Markii ugu dambeysay ee la hubiyay %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Keydi, oo hadda hubi haddii la shiday','a newer list was installed'=>'liis cusub ayaa la rakibay','already up to date'=>'horay ayuu u cusboonaaday','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'soo dejintu waxay ku guuldareysatay hubinta saxiixa waxaana la iska indhatiray','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® lama gaari karo; liiska hadda jira waa la isticmaalayaa','turned off'=>'damchay','Open'=>'Furo','Check their status page'=>'Hubi boggoodooda xaaladda','Open your billing page'=>'Fur boggaaga biilasha','Open your API keys page'=>'Fur bogtaada furayaasha API-ga','Open the AI settings'=>'Furo goobaha AI-ga','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, looma oggola inaad taas sameyso.','Unknown provider.'=>'Bixiye aan la aqoon.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Geli ciwaanka adeeggaaga, tusaale ahaan http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Taasi uma eka furaha API. Nuqul ka yeeg mar kale, adiga oo aan wadata meelo bannaan.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Horta geli furahaaga API.','Key removed.'=>'Furaha waa la saaray.','Models saved.'=>'Qaababka waa la keydiyay.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Geli magaca sax ah ee moodeelka, tusaale ahaan sida dukumentiyada bixiyaha ay u qoraan.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'La daray %s. Ka dooro hoosta "Nooca la isticmaalayo".','Model removed.'=>'Qaabka la saaray.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Cusboonaysiinada maalinlaha ah waa damtisay. Liiska la socday qalabka dheeriga ah ayaa la isticmaalayaa.','Checked: %s.'=>'La hubiyay: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Liisaska moodalka waa la cusboonaysiiyay.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Furehaydaada AI waxaa kaydiyay nooc ka cusub mid ka mid ah fiilooyinkaaga. Cusboonaysii fiiladan, ama geli furaha mar labaad oo ah goobaha AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Fureyaga AI ee la kaydiyay lama furan karo mar dambe (furayaasha amniga ee boggu waa is beddeleen). Geli mar labaad goobaha AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI lama dejinin weligiis. Ku dar furaha bixiyaha AI dejinta AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hawushan lama dooran wax nooc ah. Dooro mid ka mid ah dejinta AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-gaas laguma taageero noocaan ah ee qalab-kordhinta.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Ma jiro wax bixiyaha AI ah oo sawirro samayn kara oo ku xidhan. Ku dar furaha OpenAI ama Google Gemini dejinta AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Bixiyaha AI-gan ma sameyn karo sawirro. Dooro OpenAI ama Google Gemini sawirrada ku jira dejinta AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Furahaaga AI ma isticmaali karo wax nooca sawirka ah. Hubi ogolaanshaha furaha ee bixiyaha, ama dooro bixiye kale oo sawirrada ah.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Boggan ma gaari karo adeeggaaga AI. Hubi inuu shaqaynayo iyo in ciwaankiisa laga soo gaari karo server-kaaga shabakadda (adeeg ka dhex jira kombuyuutarkaaga lagama soo gaari karo bog la martigeliyay).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Boggani ma gaari karo %s. Hubi boggooda xaaladda; haddii ay shaqeynayaan, waxaa laga yaabaa in martigeliyahaagu uu xirayo xiriirada ka baxaya, ama ciwaanku waa khalad.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s waxa uu sheegayaa in koontadaadu ay ka dhammaatay credit ama quota. Ku dar credit ama kor u qaad xadkaaga koontadaada iyaga, kadibna mar kale isku day.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s ma aqbalin furahaaga. Waxaa laga yaabaa in si khaldan loo qoray, la baabi\'iyay ama uu dhacay. Samee fure cusub oo halkan ku dhaji.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s wuxuu diiday codsigan furahaaga. Furaha waxaa laga yaabaa inuusan marin u helin qaabkan ama muuqaalkan, ama akoonkaaga ayaa u baahan in la xaqiijiyo.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Qaabka "%1$s" waxaa laga helin %2$s furehaaga. Dooro qaab kale oo ka tirsan dejinta AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Qorshahaaga %2$s kuma jiro tusaalaha "%1$s". Dooro tusaale kale oo ku jira dejinta AI, ama ku cusboonaysii qorshahaaga iyaga.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s waxay xaddidaysaa inta ay xawaarahaagu key-gaaga ku soo diri karto codsiyada. Sug hal daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day, ama kor u qaad xadkaaga sicirka iyaga.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s wax dhibaato ah ayaa haysata hadda (cillad ama culays xad-dhaaf ah dhankooda ah). Dejintaada wax khalad ah kama jiraan. Mar kale isku day dhawaan.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Codsiga AI wuu fashilmay sabab aanan garan karin. Isku day mar kale; haddii ay sii dhacdo, la xiriir taageerada oo u dir macluumaadka hoose.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Bixiyaha AI wuxuu ku jawaabay qaab uusan ku shaqeyn karin ama uusan akhrin karin furahan (plugin). Mar kale isku day; haddii ay dhacdo mar walba, dooro nooc kale ama la xiriir taageerada.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Custom (OpenAI-compatible)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Markabkan furaha u keydi bixiyahakan marka hore.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Furahaagu wuu shaqeynayaa, laakiin bixiyaha ma liis gareynayo nooc qoraal ah (text model) oo loogu talagalay. Ku dar nooc adiga laftaadu hoos ku qoran.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Ku xidhan. %1$s waxa uu ku jawaabay adigoo isticmaalaya %2$s. Astaamahaaga AI waa diyaar in la isticmaalo.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Dooxada isticmaalahaagu uma oggola in ay ka faa\'iidaysato AI boggan. Weydii maamule.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Webkaan wuxuu gaadhay xadka uu bishii ku bixin lahaa kharashka AI-ga. Maamulaha ayaa kor u qaadi kara habaynta AI-ga.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Boggan wuxuu gaadhay xadka uu bishii isticmaali jiray ee codsiyada AI. Maamulaha ayaa kordhin kara goobaha AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Isticmaalka iyo kharashka','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Diiwaanka, xadka iyo ogolaanshaha doorka waxaa lagu dabaqaa sirdoonka macmalka (AI) ee lagu isticmaalo iyada oo loo marayo: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Kharashyada waa kuwo qiyaas ah, oo laga soo saaray qiimayaasha la daabacay; qaab aan la aqoon qiimihiisa waxaa loo tiriyaa eber.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Bishan: %1$s codsiyo, ku dhawaad %2$s.','When'=>'Goorma','Who'=>'Yaa','Used for'=>'Loo isticmaalay','Model'=>'Qaabka','Tokens in / out'=>'Calaamadaha gudaha / dibadda','About'=>'Ku saabsan','Result'=>'Natiijo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Weli lama samayn codsiyo AI ah.','Done'=>'La dhammeeyey','Limits and permissions'=>'Xadka iyo oggolaanshaha','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Xadka kharashka bisha (US dollars)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'U dhaaf madhan xadka la\'aan. AI waxay istaagaysaa inta ka dhiman bisha marka qiimaha qiyaasaha ahi uu gaaro.','Monthly request limit'=>'Xadka codsiga bishii','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'U dhaaf bannaan xad la\'aan.','Who may use AI'=>'Yaa isticmaali kara AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Calaamadi midna si aadl u oggolaato qof kasta oo isticmaali kara sifooyinka plugin-ka inuu isticmaalo AI. Maamulayaashu waxay isticmaali karaan mar walba.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Kaydi xaddidyada iyo fasaxyada','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Xadka iyo oggolaanshaha waa la keydiyay.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Khalad xagga amniga ah, fadlan dib u cusboonaysii bogga oona isku day mar kale.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Warka wargelinlaha waa maqan yahay. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Dejinta wargeyska waa mid aan sax ahayn. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Invalid email address.'=>'Ciwaanka email-ka waa mid aan ansaxeyn.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Isku dayo aad u badan. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado kooban kadib.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Wax qalad ah ayaa dhacay. Fadlan la xiriir maamulaha.','Map'=>'Khariirad','Background video'=>'Muuqaalka asalka ah','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: %2$d faylalka farta la keydiyey, xaashida qaab-dhismeedka %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'Qoyskaasi lama kaydiyo.','Removed.'=>'Waa la saaray.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Taasi ma aha magac qoys far sax ah.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts ma soo celinin qoyskaas. Hubi magaca oo dib u day.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faylasha farta lama soo dejisan karo ama lama keydin karo. Hubi in galka soo-gelinta la qori karo.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Qoraalka farta ee stylesheet-ka lama keydin karin. Hubi in galka soo-gelinta la qori karo.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Ka takhal ogeysiintaan','Design'=>'Naqshadaynta','Content'=>'Muxuu ku jiraa','Media'=>'Warbaahin','Marketing'=>'Suuqgeyn','Site'=>'Goobta','Data'=>'Xogta','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Qoraallada shaashadda maamulaha ayaa ka maqan nuqulkan barnaamijka dheeriga ah (plugin). Dib uga rakib xirmo la sii daayay.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Shaarkani wuxuu u baahan yahay JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Luuqadaha','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Horgalku waa inay noqotaa 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yar ama nambaro ah, ku billowda xaraf, mana aha inay magac ka dhigto bulginka.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Looma oggola inaad wax ka beddesho shaygan.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Tan ma aha mid la ogol yahay inaad samayso.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'Qaabka ammaanada waa la damiyay maxaa yeelay mar dambe ma waafaqsana gelitaankaaga. Dib u soo deji bogga.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Waxa habka nabdoon isticmaali kara oo keliya maamule.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Habka badbaadada leh wuxuu u baahan yahay galitaanka biraawsarka caadiga ah.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Habka badbaadada lama dejin karo.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Habka badbaadada wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaansho qoraal ah oo loo helo galka wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Habka badbaadada ayaa ku guuldareystay inuu wax ku qoro galka wp-content/mu-plugins.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Boggaasi ma jiro, ama waa la tirtiray.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, looguma oggola inaad wax ka beddesho shaygan Sandwich Studio.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio lama dhisin. Dib u rakib furaha (plugin).','Add title'=>'Ku dar cinwaan','Type / to choose a block'=>'Geli / si aad u doorato baloog','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Loading Sandwich Studio waa la soo dejinayaa…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio waxay u baahan tahay JavaScript. Isticmaal tifaftiraha caadiga ah beddelkeeda.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ka beddel “%s” adigoo wata Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Ku tiri Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Shiraarka madhan','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Ballaca kiniinka waa inay noqotaa tiro buuxda oo ah pixels laga bilaabo 480 ilaa 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Ballaca mobilku waa inay ahaataa tiro dhan oo pixels ah, ugu yaraan 240 kana yar ballaca tablet-ka.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Joogsi kasta oo caado ah wuxuu u baahan yahay aqoonsi u gaar ah: 2 ilaa 12 xaraf oo yar yar ama nambarro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Barta jabaadka ee gaarka ah waxaa la adeegsadaa ilaa ballac (200 ilaa 4000 pixels) ama laga bilaabo ballac (200 ilaa 6000 pixels), ee maaha labadaba.','Tablet'=>'Kaniini','Mobile'=>'Mobilka','Site design'=>'Naqshada goobta','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Midabada, farqadaha iyo qaababka ay wadaagaan bog kasta oo ka mid ah mareegaha iyo mawduucaaga.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Qaab-dhismeedka caalamiga ah ee bogga lama furi karin.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Font-kaasi ma aha mid ka mid ah font-yada mareegta.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Midab kasta wuxuu u baahan yahay magac gaar ah oo ka kooban xarfaha yar yar, nambarada iyo xariiqmaha dhexe.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Midabka "%s" ma aha midab CSS ah oo sax ah.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Fararım kasta waa inay yeelataa magac gaar ah oo ka kooban xarfaha yar yar, nambarka, iyo xariijimaha (hyphens).','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Font stack-ga "%s" waxa ku jiri kara kaliya magacyada font-ka, xigashooyinka, komooyinka iyo meelaha bannaan.','Uploaded icons'=>'Summersii la soo geliyay','Icon'=>'Icon','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Falkan ma aha astaamo SVG ah oo aan isticmaali karno. Wuxuu noqon karaa mid wax yeeleeyay, ama wuxuu wataa kaliya nuxur laga saaray sababo ammaan awgood (qoraallo, xiriiriyeyaal, sawirro ama farta qoraalka ah ee ku dhex jira).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Astaantu lama tirtiri karo.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'furaha ruqhadda','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Isticmaale weli lama xiriirin shatiga, taas oo lagama maarmaan u ah ka hortagga hawlgelinta aan la oggolayn. Si aad shatiga ugu abuurto isticmaalahaaga, waxaad ogolaatay inaad wadaagto magaca buuxa ee isticmaalaha WordPress iyo cinwaanka iimaylka.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'goobaha la soo sheegay','Account'=>'Koontada','Account Details'=>'Xogta Akoonka','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Koontadu waxay sugeysaa in la hawlgeliyo. Fadlan hubi iimaylkaaga oo guji xiriiriyaha si aad u hawlgeliso koontadaada ka dibna mar kale soo gudbi foomka wakiilka.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad ku darto %1$s gudaha %2$s?','Actions'=>'Tallaabooyinka','Activate'=>'Hawlgeli','Activate Free Version'=>'Dhaqaaji Nooca Lacag-La\'aanta ah'