,'%1$s automatic security & feature updates and paid functionality will keep working without interruptions until %2$s (or when your license expires, whatever comes first).'=>'%1$s cusbooneysiisyada amniga iyo sifooyinka tooska ah iyo shaqeynta lacagta ah waxay sii wadi doonaan inay shaqeeyaan iyadoon kala go\' la lahayn ilaa %2$s (ama marka shatigaagu dhaco, kaas oo soo horreeya).','%1$s to access version %2$s security & feature updates, and support.'=>'%1$s si aad u hesho nooca %2$s ee amniga & casriyeynta sifooyinka, iyo taageerada.','API'=>'API','An unknown error has occurred while trying to set the user\'s beta mode.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon ayaa dhacay intii lagu jiray isku dayga lagu dejinayay habka beta ee isticmaalaha.','An unknown error has occurred while trying to toggle the license\'s white-label mode.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon ayaa dhacay inta lagu guda jiray isku dayga lagu beddelayo habka calaamadda cad ee shatiga.','Annual'=>'Sanadle','By clicking "Opt Out", %s will no longer be able to view your name and email.'=>'Markaad gujiso "Opt Out", %s ma awoodi doonto in ay sii aragto magacaaga iyo iibsigaaga.','By clicking "Opt Out", diagnostic data will no longer be sent to %s.'=>'Markaad gujiso "Ka bax", xogta ogaanshaha cilladaha mar dambe looma diri doono %s.','By disconnecting the website, previously shared diagnostic data about %1$s will be deleted and no longer visible to %2$s.'=>'Marka laga jaro mareegta, xogta baaritaanka ee horay loo wadaagay ee ku saabsan %1$s waa la tirtiri doonaa mana sii muuqan doonto %2$s.','By opting out from sharing this information with the updates server, you’ll have to check for new %1$s releases and manually download & install them. Not just a hassle, but missing an update can put your site at risk and cause undue compatibility issues, so we highly recommend keeping these essential permissions on.'=>'Adigoo ka doorbidaya in aanad xogtan la wadaagin server-ka cusboonaysiinta, waa inaad ka hubisaa sii-daymaha cusub ee %1$s oo a