%3$s','This review link is not valid any more. Ask for a new one.'=>'Xiriirkan dib u eegista mar dambe ma shaqeynayo. Codso mid cusub.','Too many comments from this link in the last hour. Try again later.'=>'Faallooyin aad u badan oo ka yimid xidhiidhan saacaddii ugu dambaysay. Dib u day mar dambe.','Your role cannot create templates or patterns.'=>'Doorkaagu ma abuuri karo hab-raacyo ama qaabab.','You can change the text and images on this page, but not its layout or design. Your change was not saved.'=>'Waan bedeli karaa qoraalka iyo sawirrada boggan, laakiin ma bedeli karo qaab-dhismeedkiisa ama naqshaddiisa. Isbeddelkaagii waa la keydin waayay.','Your role cannot change styles. Undo the style changes and save again.'=>'Doorkaagu ma bedeli karo qaababka. Ka noqo isbeddellada qaabka oo markale keydi.','Your role cannot add or change custom code (custom CSS or HTML blocks). Undo those changes and save again.'=>'Doorkaaga ma dari karo ama ma bedeli karo koodka gaarka ah (CSS ama baloogyada HTML ee gaarka ah). Ka tirtir isbeddeladaas oo kaydi mar kale.','This is not an export file from this plugin.'=>'Tani ma aha fayl dhoofin oo ka yimid filijkan.','This export file was made by a newer version of the plugin. Update the plugin on this site, then import it again.'=>'Faylkan dhoofinta waxaa sameeyay nooc cusub oo ah qalabka ku xiran (plugin-ka). Cusboonaysii qalabka ku xiran ee boggan, kadibna dib u soo dejiso mar kale.','The export file is damaged: its list of items is missing.'=>'Faylka dhoofinta waa mid cilladaysan: liiska walxaha ayaa ka maqan.','The export file is damaged or was edited after it was made (its checksum does not match). Export it again from the other site.'=>'Fayisha dhoofinta waa mid cilladaysan ama la beddelay kadib markii la sameeyay (checksum-keedu ma waafaqsana). Mar labad ka soo dhoofi barta kale.','“%s” was not imported: this site does not have that kind of item.'=>'"%s" lama soo dejin: boggani ma laha noocaas ah shay.','“%s” was not imported: you are not allowed to create that kind of item.'=>'“%s” lama soo dejinin: looma oggola inaad abuurto noocaas ah.','“%s” was not replaced: you are not allowed to edit the one on this site.'=>'“%s” lama bedelin: looma oggola inaad wax ka beddesho kan ku yaallada boggan.','“%1$s” was not imported: %2$s'=>'“%1$s” lama soo dejinin: %2$s','Settings were not imported: only an administrator can change them.'=>'Dejinta lama keenin: mulkiile kaliya ayaa badali kara.','The image %1$s was not copied: %2$s'=>'Sawirka %1$s lama koobiyeeynin: %2$s','Show hidden suggestions on the Overview again'=>'Muuji talooyinka qarsoon ee Guudmarka mar kale','All'=>'Dhammaan','%d selected'=>'%d la doortay' . "\0" . '%d la doortay','Nothing matches.'=>'Waxba kuma soo bixin.','Select all on this page'=>'Dooro wax walba oo ku jira boggan','Select'=>'Xulo','Pages'=>'Bogagga','Previous'=>'Hore','Page %1$d of %2$d'=>'Bogga %1$d ee %2$d','Set up %s in a few minutes'=>'Samee %s daqiiqado gudahood','Start setup'=>'Bilow habaynta','This site'=>'Boggan','Edition'=>'Daabacaad','Sites on this licence'=>'Goobaha shatikan ku jira','Version'=>'Nooc','This looks like a staging or local copy, so it does not use up a site on your licence.'=>'Tani waxay u egtahay nuqul tijaabo ah ama maxalli ah, markaas ma isticmaasho goob shatigaaga ah.','See what Pro adds'=>'Arag waxa uu Pro ku darayo','Go to'=>'Tag billow','Personal'=>'Shakhsi','Business'=>'Ganacsi','Agency'=>'Wakaalad','Any number of sites'=>'Injiin kasta oo ka mid ah mareegaha','Unlimited sites'=>'Bogag aan xaddidnayn','%d site'=>'%d goob' . "\0" . '%d bogag','Pro'=>'Pro','%s trial'=>'tijaabada %s','Your trial has started. Reload the page to see every Pro feature.'=>'Tijaabadaadu waa billowday. Dib u rar bogga si aad u aragto dhammaan astaamaha Pro.','The trial could not be started.'=>'Tijaabada lama bilaabi karin.','Feature'=>'Astaamaha','Included'=>'Ku jira','Not included'=>'Lama dareersan','Your licence'=>'Shatiinkaada','%1$d of %2$d in use'=>'%1$d ka mid ah %2$d oo la isticmaalayo','Renews'=>'Cusboonaysaa','Staging, test and localhost copies of a site are free and never count toward your site limit.'=>'Nuqullada tijaabada ah, imtixaanka ah iyo kuwa localhost ee mareegaha waa kuwo bilaash ah oo aan waligood lagu darin xadka mareegahaaga.','Your plan includes priority support.'=>'Qorshahaagii waxaa ku jira taageero mudnaan leh.','Manage your licence and billing'=>'Maaree shatiyadaada iyo biilashaada','Get more with Pro'=>'Ka hel wax badan Pro-ga','Start a free %d-day trial, no card needed'=>'Bilow tijaabo bilaash ah oo ah %d maalmood, kaarka looma baahna' . "\0" . 'Bilow tijaabo bilaash ah oo ah %d maalmood, kaarka looma baahna','See plans and prices'=>'Fiiri qorshayaasha iyo qiimayaasha','Use Tranzly and Page Builder Sandwich together? The bundle includes both Pro plugins for less.'=>'Ma wada isticmaashaa Tranzly iyo Page Builder Sandwich? Xirmada waxaa ku jira labada qalab ee Pro qiimo dhimis ah.','Your licence has expired. Renew it to keep getting updates and Pro features.'=>'Shatigaagu waa dhacay. Cusboonaysii si aad u sii waddo helista wixii cusbooneysiin ah iyo astaamaha Pro.','Renew now'=>'Cusboonaysii hadda','Compare the plans'=>'Isku bar qorshayaasha','Search features'=>'Raadi astaamaha','Area'=>'Aag','Included in'=>'Ku jira','No feature matches.'=>'Ma jiro wax sifo ah oo u dhigma.','Features by plan'=>'Tilmaamaha qorshaha ku jira','Hide'=>'Qari','Activate it on the Plugins screen'=>'Ka shaqaysii shaashadda Plugins-ka','Install it'=>'Ku rakib','Overview'=>'Guud mar','Setup'=>'Dejinta','Plans and licence'=>'Qorshayaasha iyo Shatiga','Add-ons'=>'Ku-daridda','Get help'=>'Helwaan hel','Feedback'=>'Ra\'y-celinta','Your choice could not be saved.'=>'Xulashadaada lama kaydin karo.','The setup state could not be saved.'=>'Xaaladda dejinta lama keydin karo.','Match my computer'=>'Isku ekaysii kombuyuutarkayga','Light'=>'Fudud','Dark'=>'Madow','Colour scheme'=>'Midabka midabka','Help'=>'Caawimaad','Guide to this screen'=>'Hage loogu talagalay shaashaddan','Take the tour'=>'Samee booqashada hagaha','Get help or report a bug'=>'Helpu hel ama ka warbixi cillad','Plugin screens'=>'Screenaha furaha (Plugin screens)','That could not be saved.'=>'Taas lama keydin karin.','Before you contact support'=>'Int IndexPath la xiriirin taageerada','Your request is sent from this site to %s, who make this plugin. We send:'=>'Codsigaaga waxaa laga soo diray bishan ilaa %s, kuwaas oo sameeya plugins-kan. Waxaan dirnaa:','your e-mail address and name, so we can reply;'=>'cinwaankaaga iimeylka iyo magacaaga, si aan u soo jawaabno;','the subject and message you write;'=>'mawduuca iyo fariinta aad qorto;','your licence ID, so paying customers get priority;'=>'aqoonsigaaga shatiga, si macaamiisha wax bixisa ay mudnaan u helaan;','only if you tick it: site details (WordPress and PHP versions, theme, plugins, an excerpt of the error log with passwords and e-mail addresses removed), which you can read before sending;'=>'kaliya haddii aad calaamadiso: faahfaahinta goobta (noocyada WordPress iyo PHP, mawduuca, plugins-ka, qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka oo laga saaray furayaasha sirta ah iyo cinwaannada iimaylka), oo aad akhrisan karto ka hor intaadan dirin;','only if you add them: logins for your site, stored encrypted and deleted 30 days after your request is closed.'=>'kaliya haddii aad ku dartid: xogta gelitaanka ee boggaaga, oo loo kaydiyay qaab sir ah oo la tirtiray 30 maalmood kadib marka codsigaaga la xiro.','Privacy policy'=>'Siyaasadda Khaas ahaaneed','I agree, continue'=>'Waan ku raacsanahay, sii wad','The connection could not be checked.'=>'Xiriirka lama hubin karo.','That did not work. Try again.'=>'Taasi ma aysan shaqayn. Mar kale isku day.','Zinn Digital® support disconnected this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® ayaa goysay balseetan.','Zinn Digital® support no longer recognises this site.'=>'Taageerada Zinn Digital® horey uma aqoonsaneyso boggan.','You disconnected this site.'=>'Waad jartay goobtan.','Connect this site to support'=>'Ku xidh boggan taageero','Connected. Replies go to %s.'=>'Waa la xirxiiray. Jawaabaha waxay aadayaan %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Lama xiriirin. Weli waxaad soo diri kartaa codsi adoo adeegsanaya cinwaankaaga e-mail-ka ee hoose; ku xiriddu waxay badbaadineysaa in la qoro mar walba.','E-mail address'=>'Ciwaanka iimaylka','Your name (optional)'=>'Magacaaga (ikhtiyaari)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waan ku raacsanahay inaan ku xiro shabakaddan taageerada Zinn Digital®. Waxay soo diraysaa cinwaanka shabakaddan, noocyada WordPress iyo PHP iyo nooca furaha, waxaana la gooyn karaa wakhti kasta halkaan ama Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Isku xidh','I need help'=>'Waxaan u baahanahay caawimaad','Report a bug'=>'Sheeg cayayaan','Send feedback'=>'Dir प्रतिक्रिया','Request a feature'=>'Codso astaamaha','The site details could not be read.'=>'Faahfaahinta goobta lama akhrin karo.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Codsigaga lama diri karin. Iskuday mar kale daqiiqado kadib.','WordPress admin'=>'Maamulaha WordPress','File manager'=>'Maareeyaha faylasha','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Jawaab-celinta iyo codsiyada astaamaha','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'La dirir. Tixraacaagu waa %s, waxaana jawaabtayada ku soo diri doonaa iimayl.','What is it about?'=>'Maxay ku saabsan tahay?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'U jawaab (iimaylka)','Subject'=>'Mowduuc','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Maxaad samaysay, maxaad filaysay, maxase dhacay halkii laga filayey?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Ku dar faahfaahinta goobta (noocyada, mawduuca, plugins-ka iyo qayb ka mid ah diiwaanka khaladaadka)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Arag sida saxda ah ee loo diro','Loading…'=>'Soo dejinaya…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Soo-galitaanka taageero (ikhtiyaari ah, oo lagu kaydiyay sir ahaan)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Gelitaanka waxaa la diraa kaliya erayga unuggiisa ah. Ka tag saf halkii aad nus-buuxin lahayd.','Login address'=>'Ciwaanka gelitaanka','Username'=>'Magaca isticmaalaha','Password'=>'Furaha sirta ah','Add a login'=>'Ku dar galitaan','Create a temporary support login'=>'Abuur galitaanka taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Isticmaale gooni ah oo loogu talagalay kooxdayada taageero, kaas oo aan helayn marin loo helo isticmaaleyaasha, rakibidda plugins-ka ama tafatirka koodka. Waxaa si toos ah loo tirtiraa marka uu dhaco, ama mar kasta oo aad hoos uga noqoto.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Haa, %d maalmood' . "\0" . 'Haa, %d maalmood','Send'=>'Dir','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Liiska lama soo dejinin.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Gelitaankaas waa la waayay in meesha laga saaro.','Temporary support logins'=>'Gelitaarka taageerada ku-meel-gaarka ah','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Midna. Taageeradu waxay soo geli kartaa oo keliya mareegtan haddii aad halkan ka abuurto galitaan.','expired, being removed'=>'dhacay, la saarayaa','expires %s'=>'dhacayaa %s','Revoke now'=>'Hadda laabo','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Xir dalxiiska','Back'=>'Dib u noqo','Everything in one place'=>'Wax walba hal meel bay yaallaan','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Tab-alkan wuxuu kuu keenayaa shaashad kasta oo plugin-ka ah: dejinta, xuduudaha, ruqsaddaada, caawinta iyo in ka badan.','Help on every screen'=>'Caawinaad shaashad kasta ah','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fur liiskan si aad u hesho hagaha shaashadda aad ku sugan tahay, dalxiiskan, ama aad naga weydiiso caawimaad.','Light or dark'=>'Iftiinka ama mugdiga','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Dooro iftiin, madow, ama sida kombuyuutarkaaga. Xulashadaada waxaa loo xusuustaa adiga kaliya.','Welcome'=>'Soo dhawoow','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Safarkan gaaban wuxuu tusayaa halka ay wax yaaladu yaalaan. Waa inaad kaga bixi kartaa wakhti kasta adigoo adeegsanaya Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Goobtaada hal eegmo','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Halkan waxaa lagu muujiyaa horumarka habaynta iyo qorshahaaga, iyadoo lala socodsiiyo waxa xiga ee mudan in la qabto.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Qorshahaaga, tirada mareegaha ee uu daboolayo, iyo in nuqulkan mareegtu uu ku xisaabtamayo xadkaas.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Isku day Pro ama kor u qaad','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Bilow tijaabo bilaash ah adigoon isticmaalin kaarka, kor u qaad, ama cusbooneysiin, dhammaantood halkaan ka samee.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Sifo kasta iyo qorshaha ay ku jirto. Ka raadi sifo ama soo bandhig hal aag markiiba.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Wax badan oo ka socda Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Furayaasha ku shaqeeya kan, iyo adeegyada kooxdaas oo kale. Kaarka aad ku qarisay shaashadaha kale ayaa dib loogu soo bandhigi karaa halkan.','Connect for faster help'=>'Ku xidhnow caawinaad degdeg ah','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Isku xirnaashuhu waa ikhtiyaari. Waxay kuu ogolaanaysaa inaad dirto codsiyada adiga oo aan qorin iimaylkaaga mar kasta, waana aad kala gooyn kartaa mar kasta oo aad rabto.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Weydiiso caawimaad ama soo sheeg cayayaan','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Sharax waxa dhacay. Waxaad dooraneysaa in aad ku darto macluumaadka bogga, waanaad arki kartaa waxa uu ka kooban yahay marka hore.','Temporary support access'=>'Helitaanka taageero ku-meel-gaar ah','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Haddii taageeradu u baahan tahay inay eegto gudaha goobtaada, halkan ka samee gal ku-meel-gaar ah. Wuu is tirtiraa marka uu dhaco, waadna ka saari kartaa wakhti kasta.','Tell us what to build'=>'Noo sheeg waxa aad rabto in la dhiso','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'U dir fikir, codsi muuqaal ah ama wixii talo ah. Waxaa si toos ah u gaaraya kooxda.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Tani waxay qaadataa daqiiqado yar waxayna dejineysaa %s si uu si toos ah uga shaqeeyo bishan. Waxaad wax walba badali kartaa markii dambe.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Waa aad diyaar tahay. Haddii wax walba aysan u shaqayn sidii la filayey, hal gujin oo keliya ayaannu jirnaa.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Tallaabada %1$d ee %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Dhamee','Skip setup'=>'Ka bood habaynta','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Waxaa dhisay Neil Lock, oo ah madaxa fulinta ee Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Nooca %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Mareegta Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Mareegta Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'Dejinta waa la keydiyay.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Eeg qorshayaasha Pro iyo qiimahooda','Front-end output'=>'Soosaarka hore','Class name prefix'=>'Horgalaha magaca fasalka','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Magac kasta oo fasalka ah ee uu turjumaaddu ku daabaco bogaggaaga wuxuu ka bilaabmayaa horgalahan, si uusan bogaggu u muujin kan dhisay. 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yar ama nambarro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf.','Save'=>'Keydi','Beta updates'=>'Cusbooneysiinaha Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Boggan wuxuu helayaa noocyada beta cusbooneysiin ahaan.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Boggan wuxuu helayaa noocyada xasiloon kaliya.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Tan kaga beddel bogga Koontada','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Noocyada Beta waxaa la siiyaa rakibaadaha Pro ee ruqseysan ee ku xiran akoonkooda. Marka la xiro, waxaad ka soo biiri kartaa bogga Akoonka.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Biriishka waa la keydiyay. Bogaggu waxay qaadanayaan ballacyada cusub marka xigta ee la eego.','Breakpoints'=>'Go\'aanka Jebinta','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Qaababka loogu talagalay Tablet-ka waxay khuseeyaan ilaa balaca tablet-ka, kuwa loogu talagalay Mobile-kana ilaa balaca mobile-ka. Qaababka Desktop-ka waxaa lagu dabaqaa meel kasta oo kale.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Kiniini: ilaa (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Moobilaha: ilaa (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Keydi meelaha joogsiga','Use the default widths'=>'Isticmaal ballaca caadiga ah','Settings'=>'Dejinta','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Codsiga lagu beddelayo qoraalkan ayaa istaagay intii uusan dhammaan, markaa qoraalkii waa la booday. Fur si aad u beddesho, ama mar labaad uga beddel halkan.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Ma jiro wax kayd ah oo qoraalkan ah oo la soo celiyo.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Waxka la beddelay lama keydin karo.','Unknown error.'=>'Khalad aan la aqoon.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Weli lama hubin wax nuxur ah oo hore.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'So celinta waxyaabihii hore: %1$d ee %2$d qoraal.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Beddelidda nuxurkii hore: %1$d oo ka mid ah %2$d qoraallo.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Dib-u-dejintii waa dhammaatay: %1$d waa la soo celiyay, %2$d waa ay fashilmeen.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Beddelidii waa dhammaatay: %1$d waa la beddelay, %2$d waa sidoodii, %3$d waa ay fashilmeen.','Legacy content'=>'Qoraalka hore','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Bogagga lagu sameeyay noocyadii hore ee Page Builder Sandwich waxaa loo beddelaa baloogag gadaasha dambe. Qoraal kasta waa la kaydiyaa marka hore, si beddelka kasta loo tirtiro karo.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'%d qoraal ayaa weli haya nuxurkii hore.' . "\0" . '%d qoraal ayaa weli xambaarsan waxyaabaha duugga ah.','%d post has a backup.'=>'%d qoraal waxay leedahay keyd.' . "\0" . '%d qoraal waxay leeyihiin keyd.','%d post could not be handled'=>'%d qoraal lama xakamayn karo' . "\0" . '%d qoraallo lama maamuli karin','Post %d'=>'Qoraalka %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Beddeliddu waa bilowday. Waxay ka socotaa gadaasha; waad ka bixi kartaa boggan.','Convert legacy content'=>'Beddel waxyaabaha duugga ah','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad u soo celiso dhammaan qoraalladii la beddelay qaabkoodii hore? Isbeddellada lagu sameeyay qoraalladaas wixii ka dambeeyay markii la beddelay waa la lixin doonaa.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Dib u celinta waa billowday. Waxay ka socotaa gadaal; waad ka bixi kartaa boggan.','Undo all conversions'=>'Gadaal u celi dhammaan beddelallada','Alert'=>'Digniin','Information'=>'Macluumaad','Success'=>'Guul','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Digniinaha iyo khaladaadka waxaa loo sheegaa isticmaaleyaasha akhriyaha shaashadda isla markiiba; macluumaadka iyo ogeysiisyada guusha waxaa la akhriyaa marka ay dhameeyaan waxa ay wadaan.','Show icon'=>'Tus astaamaha','Visitors can close it'=>'Booqdayayaashu waa ay xidhi karaan','Title (optional)'=>'Ciwaan (ikhtiyaari)','Write the message…'=>'Qor fariinta…','section — a thematic section'=>'qeyb —qeyb mawduuc ah','div — no meaning'=>'div — ma laha macne','header — introductory content'=>'madax - waxyaabaha hordhaca ah','footer — closing content'=>'footer — xiraada nuxurka','article — self-contained content'=>'maqaal — ku filan naftiisa','aside — related content'=>'geedka — macluumaadka la xiriira','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'main — waxa ku jira barta ugu weyn (hal mar boggiikiiba)','nav — navigation links'=>'nav — xiriiriyeyaasha hagidda','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Galka (flexbox, tiir)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Safka (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Grid','Layout'=>'Qaab-dhismeedka','Editing: %s'=>'Wax ka beddelka: %s','Lay out children as'=>'U habee carruurta sida','Inherited (%s)'=>'Dhaxlay (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Blocks-ka is dul saaran','Columns'=>'Madaxyo','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Jiid shiraarka, ama qor','Content width'=>'Ballaca nuxurka','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Sanduuq (ballaca nuxurka mawduuca)','Full width'=>'Ballac buuxa','Minimum height'=>'Joogrsaha ugu yar','HTML tag'=>'Astaamaha HTML','Link'=>'Isku xir','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Samee baloogga oo dhan inuu noqdo xiriiriye ku aaddan','Link text for screen readers'=>'Qoraalka xiriiriyaha ee akhriyayaasha shaashadda','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Waxa xiriirku sameeyo, booqdayaasha aan arki karin baloogga.','Open in a new tab'=>'Ka fur tab cusub','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Haku ridin xiriiriyeyaal ama badhamo gudaha baloog ku xiran: xiriiriye ku dhex jira xiriiriye kama shaqeeyo biraawsarrada.','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Jiido si aad u beddesho cabirka tiirarkan','Drag to resize this row'=>'Jiid si aad u beddesho cabirka safkan','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'U jiid unugyada si aad u dejiso inta tiir iyo saf ee uu block-kani qaadanayo','+ Column'=>'+ Tiirka','− Column'=>'− Khadka toosan','+ Row'=>'+ Safafka','− Row'=>'Safka','Switch'=>'Beddel','Label'=>'Sumad','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Akhriyayaasha shaashadda ayaa akhriya, waana la tusiyaa marka “Muuji sumadda” shidanto.','Show label'=>'Muuji sumadda','Shortcode tag'=>'Astaamaha gaaban','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Isticmaal xarfaha, nambarada, xariijimaha iyo hoosta ka xarriiqaha kaliya.','Attribute name'=>'Magaca sifada','Add attribute'=>'Ku dar sifada','Shortcode'=>'Shortcode','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Ka dooro calaamadda gaaban goobaha baloogga.','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Kontoroolka "%s" ee tifaftiraha hore looga heli maayo tifaftiraha baloogga. Geli qiimaha sidoo kale qoraal ahaan.','Choose image'=>'Dooro sawirka','Choose file'=>'Xulo faylka','— Default —'=>'— Caadi ah —','Advanced styling'=>'Qaabeynta horumarsan','Inline CSS'=>'CSS-ka gudaha ah','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Go\'aannada CSS, tusaale ahaan: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Saamaynta (noocyadii hore)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Magacyada saamaynta ee bannaan-u-kala-baxsan ee laga soo qaaday noocyadii hore, tusaale ahaan: hover-shadow','Row'=>'Saf','Width'=>'Ballaca','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Ballac buuxa, nuxurka waxaa lagu hayaa dhexda','Link address'=>'Cinwaanka xiriirinta','Link relationship'=>'Xiriirka xiriirinta','Alignment'=>'Isku-dabarridda','Left'=>'Bidix','Centre'=>'Xarunta','Right'=>'Midig','Button text'=>'Badhanka qoraalka','Add text…'=>'Ku dar qoraal…','Accessible label'=>'Summaddu la heli karo','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Astaamaha qurxinta uga tag eber.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Ka dooro sumad goobta dejinta baloogga.','New setting name'=>'Magaca dejinta cusub','For example: title or text'=>'Tusaale ahaan: cinwaan ama qoraal','Add setting'=>'Ku dar habeyn','Widget'=>'Widget','Choose a widget'=>'Xulo qalab yar','Widget area'=>'Goobta widget-ka','Choose a widget area'=>'Dooro aagagga farmaajada','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Sawirkan ma laha ballac iyo dherer, sidaas darteed boggu wuu boodi doonaa marka uu soo hogo. Sii ka dooro Maktabadda Warbaahinta (Media Library), ama dhig ballaciisa iyo dhererkiisa.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Muuqaalkani kama iman Maktabadda Warbaahinta, markaa cabbirkiisu lama yaqaan oo boggu wuu boodi doonaa mark uu soo shubmayo. Beddelkeeda, geli Maktabadda Warbaahinta.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Muuqaal, fiiyo ama qaab ku jira HTML-kan malaha balac iyo dherer, marka boggu wuu boodayaa marka uu soo go\'ayo. Ku dar sifooyinka balaca iyo dhererka (width and height).','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Kani wuxuu iskaba beddelaa cabbirka marka uu soo shubo, taas oo dhaqaajisa waxyaabaha hoostiisa ku yaal. Sii boos ama dhig hoose ee bogga.','Layout shift'=>'Isbeddelka qaab-dhismeedka','Desktop'=>'Desktop','Default'=>'Caadi ah','Every track'=>'Jidad kasta','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Cabirrada raadraaca, tusaale ahaan: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Cabirrada dabaqyada ee gaarka ah','Equal tracks'=>'Gawaari siman','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Safka mid walba oo lagu xidhay xigasho halkii safba, tusaale ahaan: "head head" "side main". Magacaw aagga ku yaal xannibaad kasta oo carruur ah.','Automatic'=>'Otomatik ah','Square (1:1)'=>'Garaab (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Caadiga ah (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Dhaqameed (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Ballaran (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Sinema (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Dheer (9:16)','Custom'=>'Gaar ah','Width / height'=>'Ballaca / Joogugga','Top'=>'Sare','Bottom'=>'Hoose','Background image'=>'Sawirka asalka ah','Inherited image — replace'=>'Sawirka la dhaxlay - beddel','Remove image'=>'Ka saar sawirka','Position'=>'Booska','Size'=>'Cabbirka','Cover'=>'Dabool','Contain'=>'Hayso','Original size'=>'Cabbirka asalka ah','Repeat'=>'Ku celi','No repeat'=>'Laba jibaar ma jiro','Tile'=>'Tile','Tile across'=